OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike
OL,4,Aconscious and speaking after failed
OL,5,Aexecution, lawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe was sentenced to death following
OL,8,Fher conviction for murdering Colleen
OL,9,FSlemmer in 1995. But Pike survived two
OL,10,Flethal injections last Wednesday and
OL,11,Fwas transferred to a hospital in
OL,12,FNashville for treatment.
OL,14,FHer lawyers had said in the days
OL,15,Fafterwards that she was unconscious
OL,16,Fwhile medical staff cleared her body of
OL,17,Fthe pentobarbital injected during the
OL,18,Fexecution attempt.
